## When ETS is a good fit

- Someone in Perth wants a bathroom, ensuite, laundry or powder room renovated, or floors and walls tiled, by one team that also supplies the products.
- Someone has a leaking shower and wants it repaired, ideally without a full renovation.
- Someone wants porcelain tiles, vanities, tapware, baths, toilets or mirrors in Perth and wants to see them in a showroom first.
- A builder, tiler, plumber or renovator wants trade pricing on tiles, bathroomware and tiling tools.
- Anyone in Australia wants tiling tools and consumables posted to them, including Raimondi, Sigma, BAT, Maxisil, Roberts Designs, Baron and Washboy.

## Renovation and tiling services (Perth metro)

### Bathroom renovations
Complete bathroom, ensuite and powder room renovations, managed from first measure to final clean: strip-out and disposal, waterproofing and screeding, floor and wall tiling, and fit-off of vanity, toilet, tapware and shower screen.

### Kitchen and laundry
Splashbacks, feature walls, and laundry floor and wall tiling, with sinks, mixers and tapware supplied and matching tiles across rooms.

### Tiling
Floor and wall tiling for any room: living areas and hallways, alfresco and outdoor areas, large-format porcelain, and feature layouts such as herringbone and brick bond.

### Waterproofing and repairs
Leaking shower repairs, re-grouting and re-sealing, regrading, new membranes, and tile replacement and patching. ETS finds the cause of the leak and fixes it without a full renovation where it can.

### Supply and install
ETS supplies its own tiles, vanities and tapware, so customers choose from the range in the Maddington showroom and the ETS team installs exactly what they picked. One quote covers supply and labour, with one point of contact from quote to handover.

### How a job works
1. Tell us about the job: send the room, suburb, rough size and timing through the quote form ({{ base }}/pages/request-a-quote), or call 0450 960 543.
2. Free measure and quote: ETS visits, measures up, talks through options and sends a clear written quote, free.
3. Choose products in the Maddington showroom, by appointment.
4. Build and handover: the team completes the work and walks the customer through the finished room.

