## Trade accounts

Builders, tilers, plumbers and renovators can apply for a trade account with their ABN ({{ base }}/pages/trade-account). Approved accounts get 5 to 25% off depending on the item, applied automatically in the cart after logging in. Bulk tile and project quantities are quoted on request, with Perth metro delivery to site or pickup from Maddington.

## Delivery and pickup

- Small items (tapware, shower sets, towel rails, accessories, silicone, grout and tools) post anywhere in Australia by tracked Australia Post. Small items also ship to New Zealand, the United States, the United Kingdom and the United Arab Emirates.
- Tiles and large items (vanities, baths, toilets, shower screens and long trims) are delivered across the Perth metro area or picked up free from Maddington. Outside Perth they go by freight quote.
- Delivery options and charges for each order are shown at checkout. Current rates are in the shipping policy: {{ base }}/policies/shipping-policy
- Free pickup from 17A Olga Road, Maddington: choose pickup at checkout, wait until ETS confirms the order is ready, book a pickup time ({{ base }}/pages/book-appointment) and bring the order number.

## Returns and warranty

- Change-of-mind returns are accepted within 30 days of receiving an order, for unused products in original packaging. A restocking fee applies. Details: {{ base }}/policies/refund-policy
- Faulty, damaged or incorrect products are covered under the Australian Consumer Law, and restocking fees never apply to them.
- Products come with the manufacturer's warranty plus Australian Consumer Law rights ({{ base }}/pages/product-care).

## Frequently asked questions

**Where is ETS?** 17A Olga Road, Maddington WA 6109, in Perth's south-eastern suburbs.

**Can I just drop in to the showroom?** No. The showroom is open by appointment only, Monday to Saturday from 4:30 pm to 9 pm. Book at {{ base }}/pages/book-appointment or call 0450 960 543.

**Which areas do you cover for renovations?** The Perth metro area. Send your suburb with your enquiry and ETS will confirm.

**Do you supply the products as well?** Yes. Tiles, vanities, basins, tapware, toilets, mirrors and accessories can all come from the ETS range.

**Can you fix a leaking shower without a full renovation?** Often, yes. Depending on the cause, a leak can sometimes be fixed by re-grouting and re-sealing, regrading, or replacing the membrane in the affected area. ETS inspects it and explains the options.

**How do I get a quote?** Fill in the quote form at {{ base }}/pages/request-a-quote with your suburb, the room, approximate size and timing, or call 0450 960 543. Photos help.

**Do you deliver tiles outside Perth?** Tiles are delivered within the Perth metro area or picked up from Maddington. Outside Perth, ask for a freight quote.

**How much tile should I order?** Measure the area in square metres and add 10% for cuts and breakages (15 to 20% for herringbone or diagonal layouts). Every tile page has a calculator.

**Is everything in stock?** Not always. Some products are ordered in. If you need something by a certain date, call to check before ordering.

**Where do I find sizes and specs?** On each product page, under Specifications.

**How do I get trade pricing?** Apply for a trade account with your ABN and trade details. Once approved, log in and the trade discount comes off in the cart.

